# Implementation Plan - Stitch UI Design Integration

We will use **Stitch** to elevate the UI/UX of the Math Visualizer. By defining a first-class Design System and generating high-fidelity screen mockups, we'll establish a more professional and visually consistent "Editorial Dark Mode" experience.

## User Review Required

> [!IMPORTANT]
> I will create a new "Design Project" and "Design System" in Stitch. This will define our official color palette (Pitch Black, Manim Yellow/Red/Blue) and typography (Outfit, EB Garamond).

> [!TIP]
> Once the Design System is established, I'll generate a "High-Fidelity Explainer Dashboard" screen in Stitch. This mockup will guide our final CSS and layout refinements in the React codebase.

